a, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">IN/AIF3/25-26/2108</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 4px 8px 4px;border-top:1px solid #B9B2A5;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;color:#7B8491\">This email is for introduction purposes only and does not constitute an offer, solicitation or commitment to invest. Any investment is subject to the Fund&#x27;s due diligence, investment committee approval and applicable SEBI regulations. To stop receiving emails from us, reply with “unsubscribe”.</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
